## SQLite

- Public domain.
- Used through Qt's `QSQLITE` driver for the local workspace database.

## libsecret

- License: LGPL-2.1-or-later.
- Used to store provider API keys in the Secret Service. When unavailable,
  credentials are session-only and never written to disk.

## Fonts

Qt resolves UI text through the system font database. If the interface style
specifies a monospace family it only requests an installed family by name
(see `Theme.qml`); no font files are bundled.

## Prompts

All AI prompt templates in `src/ai/textactions.cpp` are original text written
for this project from behavioral descriptions of the Writero web app. No
upstream prompt text is copied.

